{
  "_doc": "Vault = layout + lock + lockdown hazard + staff dependency. Each lock and hazard lists solutions. A solution is feasible for a seed when every room in requires.rooms exists in the generated bank and every part in requires.parts is found in at least one existing room (see weapons_gadgets.json parts.found_in). The validator demands min_vault_lock_solutions and min_vault_hazard_solutions feasible solutions. cost fields: time_s, noise_m, alert (raises building alert), traceable (police Tech can counter-hack). budget_cost is spent from the tier's security_budget; whatever is left buys cameras (camera_cost) and guards (guard_cost), so a hard vault means softer security elsewhere.",
